      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{58c6d558ff44e44ada717902|full_name}: Yeah, whatever you guys feel makes sense. It's just the visibility the hand provided. It might not make a ton of sense if you feel a raised avatar hand or the \"waving to a friend\" emote works well.\n\nAnd honestly, I believe I have seen raised avatar hands working fine in events.\n\nI think I was just struck by the social atmosphere in AltSpace at endgame last night. I'm probably over thinking this request.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
