  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "One feature that AltSpace has (had) was an emoji that showed a raised hand above your head.\n\nI know people with motion controls can raise their hands, but it's not always as visible as this emoji was.\n\nI'd like to suggest some sort of feature that could be used at events/talk shows to clearly indicate to those in charge they have something to say. This in world structure would help facilitate good behavior and clear cultural norms at events.",
